  "method": [
    "Rr / (vol rho g) = a0 + (a1 LCBfpp/Lwl + a2 Cp + a3 vol^(2/3)/Aw + a4 Bwl/Lwl + a5 vol^(2/3)/Sc + a6 LCBfpp/LCFfpp + a7 (LCBfpp/Lwl)^2 + a8 Cp^2) vol^(1/3)/Lwl; LCBfpp and LCFfpp in m aft of the FP; coefficients linear in Fn between rows, zero at Fn 0, extrapolated linearly above Fn 0.60.",
    "dRr(20 deg) / (vol rho g) = 1e-3 (u0 + u1 Lwl/Bwl + u2 Bwl/Tc + u3 (Bwl/Tc)^2 + u4 LCB + u5 LCB^2), LCB in % Lwl from Lwl/2, positive forward; linear in Fn, zero at Fn 0, held above Fn 0.55; dRr(phi) = 6.0 phi^1.7 dRr(20 deg), phi in rad.",
    "Sc(phi) = Sc (1 + (s0 + s1 Bwl/Tc + s2 (Bwl/Tc)^2 + s3 Cm) / 100), linear in heel between rows, zero at 0 deg, held above 35 deg.",
    "Rf = 0.5 rho V^2 Sc(phi) Cf (1 + k), Cf = 0.075 / (log10 Re - 2)^2, Re = 0.7 Lwl V / nu, 1 + k = 1.",
    "Residuary = max(0, Rr + dRr(phi)): the regression gives Rr slightly below zero around Fn 0.10.",
    "V = Fn sqrt(g Lwl), g = 9.81 m/s^2. All hull parameters are upright."
  ],
